          "content": "File: aiapi/README.md\nIMPORTANT: File content truncated.\n\tStatus: Showing lines 501-750 of 901 total lines.\n\tTo read more: Use the read_file tool with offset=751 and limit=250.\n\t\n\t501 | |--------|------|----------|\n502 | | Kilo-Code | `Kilo-Code` | 严格模式：每次只能 1 个 tool call，纯文本自动包装为 attempt_completion |\n503 | | RooCode | `RooCode` | 同 Kilo-Code |\n504 | | Claude Code | `claudecode` | 零宽会话 ID 在 tool_calls 前单独发送 |\n505 | | 其他 | — | 宽松模式，不强制校验工具调用 |\n506 | \n507 | ### 会话追踪\n508 | \n509 | | 模式 | 实现 | 说明 |\n510 | |------|------|------|\n511 | | Hash | 消息内容 SHA256 | 默认模式，基于 systemPrompt + messages 哈希 |\n512 | | ZeroWidth | 零宽字符嵌入 | 在助手回复中嵌入不可见的 sessionId |\n513 | \n514 | ### 并发门控\n515 | \n516 | - **RejectConcurrent**：同一会话有请求在执行时，新请求返回 409 Conflict\n517 | - **CancelPrevious**：取消之前的请求，执行新请求\n518 | - 使用 RAII `ExecutionGuard` 自动管理生命周期\n519 | \n520 | ### 错误统计系统\n521 | \n522 | 错误按 4 个域分类：\n523 | \n524 | | 域 | 说明 | 典型事件 |\n525 | |------|------|----------|\n526 | | `SESSION_GATE` | 会话并发门控 | 并发冲突、请求取消 |\n527 | | `UPSTREAM` | 上游 Provider | HTTP 错误、超时 |\n528 | | `TOOL_BRIDGE` | 工具桥接 | XML 未找到、校验过滤、降级、强制生成 |\n529 | | `INTERNAL` | 内部异常 | 运行时异常、未知错误 |\n530 | \n531 | 配置通过 `ErrorStatsConfig` 管理，支持运行时调整保留策略。\n532 | \n533 | ### HTTP 过滤器\n534 | \n535 | | 过滤器 | 作用范围 | 说明 |\n536 | |--------|----------|------|\n537 | | AdminAuthFilter | `/aichat/*` | Bearer Token 认证，`admin_api_key` 为空时跳过（向后兼容） |\n538 | | RateLimitFilter | AI API 端点 | 令牌桶限流，可配置 `requests_per_second` 和 `burst` |\n539 | \n540 | ## API 使用示例\n541 | \n542 | ### Chat Completions API\n543 | \n544 | ```bash\n545 | # 非流式\n546 | curl -X POST \"http://localhost:55555/chaynsapi/v1/chat/completions\" \\\n547 |   -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n548 |   -d '{\n549 |     \"model\": \"GPT-4o\",\n550 |     \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello\"}]\n551 |   }'\n552 | \n553 | # 流式\n554 | curl -N -X POST \"http://localhost:55555/chaynsapi/v1/chat/completions\" \\\n555 |   -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n556 |   -d '{\n557 |     \"model\": \"GPT-4o\",\n558 |     \"stream\": true,\n559 |     \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello\"}]\n560 |   }'\n561 | ```\n562 | \n563 | ### Responses API\n564 | \n565 | ```bash\n566 | # 创建 Response\n567 | curl -X POST \"http://localhost:55555/chaynsapi/v1/responses\" \\\n568 |   -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n569 |   -d '{\n570 |     \"model\": \"GPT-4o\",\n571 |     \"input\": \"Hello\"\n572 |   }'\n573 | \n574 | # 续聊\n575 | curl -X POST \"http://localhost:55555/chaynsapi/v1/responses\" \\\n576 |   -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n577 |   -d '{\n578 |     \"model\": \"GPT-4o\",\n579 |     \"previous_response_id\": \"resp_abc123\",\n580 |     \"input\": \"Tell me more.\"\n581 |   }'\n582 | \n583 | # 获取 Response\n584 | curl \"http://localhost:55555/chaynsapi/v1/responses/{response_id}\"\n585 | \n586 | # 删除 Response\n587 | curl -X DELETE \"http://localhost:55555/chaynsapi/v1/responses/{response_id}\"\n588 | ```\n589 | \n590 | ### 账号管理\n591 | \n592 | ```bash\n593 | # 添加账号\n594 | curl -X POST \"http://localhost:55555/aichat/account/add\" \\\n595 |   -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n596 |   -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_KEY\" \\\n597 |   -d '{\n598 |     \"apiname\": \"chaynsapi\",\n599 |     \"username\": \"user@example.com\",\n600 |     \"password\": \"xxx\"\n601 |   }'\n602 | \n603 | # 自动注册 5 个账号\n604 | curl -X POST \"http://localhost:55555/aichat/account/autoregister\" \\\n605 |   -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n606 |   -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_KEY\" \\\n607 |   -d '{\"apiname\": \"chaynsapi\", \"count\": 5}'\n608 | \n609 | # 刷新所有账号状态\n610 | curl -X POST \"http://localhost:55555/aichat/account/refresh\" \\\n611 |   -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_KEY\"\n612 | ```\n613 | \n614 | ### 渠道管理\n615 | \n616 | ```bash\n617 | # 添加渠道\n618 | curl -X POST \"http://localhost:55555/aichat/channel/add\" \\\n619 |   -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n620 |   -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_KEY\" \\\n621 |   -d '[{\n622 |     \"channelname\": \"main\",\n623 |     \"channeltype\": \"chaynsapi\",\n624 |     \"channelurl\": \"https://api.example.com\",\n625 |     \"channelkey\": \"sk-xxx\",\n626 |     \"maxconcurrent\": 10,\n627 |     \"supports_tool_calls\": false\n628 |   }]'\n629 | \n630 | # 获取渠道列表\n631 | curl \"http://localhost:55555/aichat/channel/list\" \\\n632 |   -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_KEY\"\n633 | ```\n634 | \n635 | ### 监控\n636 | \n637 | ```bash\n638 | # 服务状态概览\n639 | curl \"http://localhost:55555/aichat/metrics/status/summary\" \\\n640 |   -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_KEY\"\n641 | \n642 | # 错误时序统计（最近 24 小时）\n643 | curl \"http://localhost:55555/aichat/metrics/errors/series\" \\\n644 |   -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_KEY\"\n645 | \n646 | # 日志尾部（过滤 ERROR 级别）\n647 | curl \"http://localhost:55555/aichat/logs/tail?lines=100&level=ERROR\" \\\n648 |   -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_KEY\"\n649 | \n650 | # 健康检查\n651 | curl \"http://localhost:55555/health\"\n652 | curl \"http://localhost:55555/ready\"\n653 | \n654 | # Prometheus 指标\n655 | curl \"http://localhost:55555/metrics\"\n656 | ```\n657 | \n658 | ## 构建与运行\n659 | \n660 | ### 依赖\n661 | \n662 | - C++17 或更高版本\n663 | - Drogon 框架\n664 | - JsonCpp\n665 | - OpenSSL\n666 | - spdlog\n667 | - PostgreSQL / MySQL / SQLite3（可选，通过 `dbtype` 配置切换）\n668 | \n669 | ### 本地构建\n670 | \n671 | ```bash\n672 | cd aiapi/src\n673 | mkdir build && cd build\n674 | cmake ..\n675 | make -j$(nproc)\n676 | ```\n677 | \n678 | ### 运行测试\n679 | \n680 | ```bash\n681 | cd aiapi/src/build\n682 | ctest --output-on-failure\n683 | # 或直接运行测试可执行文件\n684 | ./test/aiapi_test\n685 | ```\n686 | \n687 | ### 运行\n688 | \n689 | ```bash\n690 | cd aiapi/src/build\n691 | ./aiapi\n692 | ```\n693 | \n694 | 服务默认监听 `0.0.0.0:55555`\n695 | \n696 | ### Docker 构建与运行\n697 | \n698 | ```bash\n699 | # 方式一：环境变量注入配置\n700 | docker compose -f docker-compose.env.yml up --build aiapi\n701 | \n702 | # 方式二：卷挂载配置文件\n703 | cp config.example.json config.json\n704 | # 编辑 config.json 填入实际配置\n705 | docker compose -f docker-compose.volume.yml up --build aiapi\n706 | \n707 | # 方式三：SQLite + 卷挂载持久化\n708 | cp config.sqlite.example.json config.json\n709 | mkdir -p data logs cores\n710 | # config.json 中默认使用 ./data/aiapi.db，对应宿主机 ./data/aiapi.db\n711 | docker compose -f docker-compose.volume.yml up --build aiapi\n712 | ```\n713 | \n714 | `docker-compose.env.yml` 与 `docker-compose.volume.yml` 中的服务名、镜像名、容器名均统一为 `aiapi`。\n715 | \n716 | Docker 入口脚本支持：\n717 | - `CONFIG_JSON` 环境变量 → 直接覆盖配置文件\n718 | - `CUSTOM_CONFIG` 环境变量 → 使用 jq 合并到现有配置\n719 | \n720 | ## 配置说明\n721 | \n722 | 配置文件位于 `config.example.json`，主要配置项：\n723 | \n724 | ```json\n725 | {\n726 |   \"listeners\": [\n727 |     { \"address\": \"0.0.0.0\", \"port\": 55555 }\n728 |   ],\n729 |   \"db_clients\": [\n730 |     { \"name\": \"aichatpg\", \"rdbms\": \"postgresql\", \"host\": \"...\", \"...\": \"...\" }\n731 |   ],\n732 |   \"app\": {\n733 |     \"number_of_threads\": 4,\n734 |     \"log\": {\n735 |       \"use_spdlog\": true,\n736 |       \"log_level\": \"DEBUG\"\n737 |     },\n738 |     \"cors\": { \"enabled\": true, \"allow_origins\": [\"*\"] }\n739 |   },\n740 |   \"plugins\": [\n741 |     { \"name\": \"drogon::plugin::PromExporter\", \"config\": { \"path\": \"/metrics\" } },\n742 |     { \"name\": \"drogon::plugin::AccessLogger\" }\n743 |   ],\n744 |   \"custom_config\": {\n745 |     \"dbtype\": \"sqlite3\",\n746 |     \"admin_api_key\": \"\",\n747 |     \"session_tracking\": {\n748 |       \"mode\": \"zerowidth\"\n749 |     },\n750 |     \"tool_bridge\": {"
